  "name": "Mussels in Spiced Tomato Broth",
  "subtitle": "Mussels simmered with tomato, citrus, chili, and savory spice",
  "description": "A bright, spicy tomato broth seasoned with lemon, vinegar, vodka, and dashi makes a flavorful base for tender mussels.",
